LVHVBox

Applications and firmware are built from source. Custom Debian packaging
scripts and metadata have been removed.

Service source build: lvhv-server/README.md
Shared LVHV Python codec: common/README.md and protocol/README.md
SmartSwitch firmware direct build: SmartSwitch/README.md
Native Pico BOOTSEL helper direct build: pico-bootsel/README.md
X728 power handling and shutdown helper: pi-health-server/README.md

Pi health provides X728 power handling directly; no vendor submodule is required.

SmartSwitch CMake targets select each Pico identity and USB VID automatically.
Building an image/helper is separate from deploying services, flashing firmware
or executing a hardware command; those require their own operational steps.
